	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Universal wah inductor. Four radial runways (3 holes each) give 2-lead spacings 10.8 / 12.6 / 14.4 / 16.2 / 18.0 mm - 14.4 mm matches the stompboxparts ME-6. Plus a 14.85 x 12.29 mm four-post rectangle for the Thomas Organ TDK 5103 cube and the stack-of-dimes; on those the LEFT pair is electrical (pads 1/2) and the right pair is mechanical, matching the original 25-5500-2 artwork.")
